 Newton←{ti tc tr tg d0 di dd dx dn←⍺ ⋄ p d←⍵           ⍝ universal trust-region newton solver

     D←((dx-d0)×dn-⍨⊢)÷(d0-dn)×dx-⊢                     ⍝ damping factor normalization (λ)
     E←¯4↑⊂⍤⊢,⍺⍺                                        ⍝ evaluate user function

     T←{                                                ⍝ try guess(λ)
         r⊢←0 ⋄ 11::dx⌊⍵×di ⋄ b←1-÷1⌈d⊢←D ⍵             ⍝   bad guess if domain error
         ∆p←-g⌹h+⍺×⍤1⊢⍵×dh←(⎕CT+b-⎕CT×b)⌈1 1⍉h          ⍝   solve (H + λD)∆p = g
         c0←-2÷⍨∆p+.×g-∆p×⍵×dh                          ⍝   predicted error decrement
         c1←c-⊃1↓n←p c h g E⊢q←p+∆p                     ⍝   actual error decrement
         r⊢←(p(-÷∘(⎕CT∘⌈)⍥(+.×⍨)⊣)q)⌊c1÷c               ⍝   relative change metric
         (0>c0)∨(⎕CT>c0)∧⎕CT<c1:dx⌊⍵×di                 ⍝   if not changing, increase damping
         (⎕CT≤c0)∧tg≥c1÷c0:dx⌊⍵×di                      ⍝   if diverging, increase damping
         dn⌈⍵×dd⊣p c h g⊢←n                             ⍝   accept state, decrease damping
     }
     C←⍵⍵{                                              ⍝ convergence check(λ_prev, λ)
         _←⍺⍺(i⊢←i+1)c r d p                            ⍝   call callback
         (ti<i)∨(dx∧.=⍺ ⍵)∨(tc>c)∨(i>1)∧(r≥0)∧tr>r      ⍝   check termination criteria
     }
     i r←0 ⋄ 0≥ti⊣⍵⍵ s←i c r d p⊣p c h g←E p:s          ⍝ init state
     i c r d p⊣(∘.=⍨⍳≢p)T⍣C{11::dx ⋄ D⍣¯1⊢⍵}d           ⍝ main iteration loop
 }
